{
 "text": {
  "Another hopeful at my gate. Good. The realm needs a few.": "63ff9269b408",
  "Here is how it works. The king is dead. Seven of us are Wardens of Vael, and whoever earns all seven of our seals before the season ends sits the Ashen Throne.": "1cdcbccf4e5b",
  "Mine is the first. A lord who can’t drive can’t hold a realm. Whistle for your chariot with C, climb up with E, and take the Greywater markers in under a minute and a half.": "66883225ef94",
  "You drive like someone who means to arrive. The seal of the Gate is yours.": "4f7f79be3c7d",
  "Press J for your Seal Book. Next, Kain Warwick at the Mint. Nobody sits a throne without coin.": "5eef699aafdd",
  "A seat is a chair until there’s coin under it.": "8eeadcdadfa8",
  "Every house strikes its own coin here, on NEAR, and every house is a merchant. Rush to buy and it’s dear; flood it with selling and it’s cheap. Buy some of your house’s coin.": "dfd28b15c246",
  "Then go home. Every hall in Vael has a game, and every round played burns that house’s coin. Play yours once. That’s how a coin earns its price here.": "56549a2c52ae",
  "Word from the Mint, my lord: Master Warwick has sent his seal. He says you understand what a coin is for.": "a00bd0372199",
  "The other Wardens will see you now, in any order you like. The Seal Book (J) has them all.": "3b2e95afe4c8",
  "A bridge you can’t check is a long way down. I don’t take anyone’s word for what’s on the other side.": "39755fb66ff9",
  "The vintner at Vinehold swears you can’t follow his cups. Prove him wrong. The chain replays every shuffle, so it will know. Watch everything; trust nothing.": "fea6f26bea65",
  "Verified. The seal of the Bridge, and my respect, which is harder to get.": "c2e3c7d171b3",
  "I count every ship that comes into Greywater. Every one, every season. The count tells you where the realm is going before the realm knows.": "fad1f36a6fad",
  "Ashveil’s signal hall talks the ships in by lantern. Go and bring me six.": "b2d932e47d1a",
  "Six, logged. That’s a good season for one evening. The seal of the Lighthouse.": "a0abe1850e66",
  "Sit down. Every lord in Vael bluffs. Very few do it well, and I’ve watched most of them try.": "5169bf5be653",
  "Liar’s Dice. Five each, under the cup. Come inside, sit across from me, and beat me. Then the Library’s seal is yours.": "1f5f4b43d1c5",
  "Well played. I’ll be thinking about that last call for a week. The seal of the Library.": "6c489888f66c",
  "Eight houses, eight teams, one line. Fast is the only speed I respect.": "f76dfc5b8913",
  "Take the reins for your house. Top four and the seal of the Hippodrome is yours. Inside lanes are short. Crowded too.": "733127e6b6c7",
  "I laid these roads so that anyone could walk them, and here you are with six seals. Pay attention now; it’s all you need.": "12f7a203161f",
  "A throne is held by the houses, not the Wardens. Win the favour of three halls, then win the Crown Race outright.": "a65c96a15707",
  "Ravens are cheaper than armies, my lord. Usually.": "765bf0910a4a",
  "Muster at the Gershuni Gate, then ride ahead. I want eyes on their walls before our banners reach them.": "8e90e3c53c7f",
  "Their walls are thin on the river side. Our column will be there by dusk. Well ridden, my lord.": "319ae4616d7a",
  "The old king of Vael is dead, and the Ashen Throne stands empty.": "45e4ab7f936d",
  "By the old law, the crown goes to whoever earns the seals of the Seven Wardens before the season ends.": "cfe825df5818",
  "Eight houses want it. Each strikes its own coin on NEAR, and every coin a house burns is a vote for it.": "1b1b46191971",
  "You are new here: a name, a seat, a borrowed chariot. The Warden of the Gate is waiting. Follow the yellow light.": "39e77bd67380",
  "Press J whenever you like. The Seal Book has every trial and every hall in it.": "3bfb54da4048",
  "Every round in a hall burns that house’s coin. Your own house’s coin goes up when people play in your hall.": "53a99a2c5d1f",
  "The lit doors on the keeps are open to anyone. Every hall has its own game, and every round you play there burns that house’s coin: the burn is your favour with it.": "948de61d1ec1",
  "The radar’s yellow letters are the Wardens. The bright beam over the land is where you should be going.": "29292e3aa370",
  "At the Hippodrome the inside lane is shortest. Crack the whip on the straights, not in the turns.": "91c2f1f8f7d5"
 },
